## Project Context
korays-framework is a Python library that automates Koray-style topical authority SEO.
It runs a 9-step pipeline: fetch URLs → cluster topics → generate briefs → score → export Markdown/PDF.

## Language
- Python >= 3.9
- `from __future__ import annotations` must be present in every module

## Coding Standards
- Full type hints on all functions and dataclass fields
- `@dataclass` for data transfer objects
- `logging.getLogger(__name__)` for all log output; no bare `print()`
- No circular imports — modules may only import from earlier pipeline steps

## Module Map
```
korays/seed_collector.py   → SeedCollector   (Step 1)
korays/normalizer.py       → Normalizer      (Step 2)
korays/clusterer.py        → Clusterer       (Step 3)
korays/hierarchy_builder.py→ HierarchyBuilder(Step 4)
korays/brief_generator.py  → BriefGenerator  (Step 5)
korays/scorer.py           → Scorer          (Step 6)
korays/internal_linker.py  → InternalLinker  (Step 7)
korays/exporter.py         → Exporter        (Step 8)
korays/refresher.py        → Refresher       (Step 9)
```

## Testing
